'''Hideyho''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Hideyho''' spawns somewhere inside the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome.

== Behavior ==
'''Hideyho''' spawns somewhere in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome. If the player interacts with it, they can start a game of hide and seek, causing it to hide somewhere else in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome and apply {{PotN|Blindness II}} for {{Green|1}} second. Upon being found again, it rewards the player with a {{Item|Hideyho Shard}}.

