{{Safari Critter Loot Explanation|xp = 300}}

The amount of {{Item|Hideyho Shard}}s depends on how long it took the player to find it. If the player takes longer than {{Green|1m}} to find '''Hideyho''', they get {{Item|Hideyho Shard|amount=1}}. If the player takes {{Green|1m}} or less, they get {{Item|Hideyho Shard|amount=2}}s. If the player finds them in {{Green|30s}} or less, they get {{Item|Hideyho Shard|amount=3}}s.

